arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T09:48:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:48:39Z","body":"Yes. I read the contribution policy in full before submitting the PR.\r\n\r\nThe actual changes were made by me. I only used AI at the end as an additional quality check, and treated its suggestions as reference rather than something to apply blindly.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792641170/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792646694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746#issuecomment-5792646694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746","id":5792646694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWUTGJg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T09:49:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:49:04Z","body":"Great thank you!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5792646694/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5798948188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746#issuecomment-5798948188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746","id":5798948188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWaTtXA","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T16:50:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:09:54Z","body":"So, this is a substantial step forward. I built this, everything runs without errors, and I also got all your test cases to pass. This fixes one of the main issues mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462.\r\n\r\nThe one case that I *am* getting to break is with this example:\r\n<img width=\"577\" height=\"313\" alt=\"fuzzy_textures\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7f2c8f3-c329-4fc8-802e-4dbb1852b82d\" />\r\n**(with ProjectSettings set to Linear)**\r\n\r\nFor whatever reason, pixel art textures used on the TextureRect or on the Sprite2D both use Linear instead of Nearest. ~~The SubViewport seems to be inheriting SubViewportContainer's value instead of overriding with Nearest.~~ I believe what's happening is the container is rendering all of its descendants with Linear since that's what it inherited, and then after the linear filter is applied, the SubviewPort is rendering them with Nearest (which does nothing since they're already blurry.\r\n\r\nI'm pretty sure this is not intentional? If Viewport specifies a `canvas_item_default_texture_filter` other than Inherit, then all the children should use that filter, not be rendered with the parent's filter.\r\n\r\nEdit above.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5798948188/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5807296808","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746#issuecomment-5807296808","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746","id":5807296808,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWiRRKA","user":{"login":"fsfgrafb","id":86371613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzcxNjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86371613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb","html_url":"https://github.com/fsfgrafb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T03:55:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T03:55:52Z","body":"I tried reproducing your example and noticed that either setting the SubViewportContainer’s Texture Filter to Nearest or changing the project’s default filter to Nearest made the result sharp.\r\n\r\nI think there may be two filtering stages here: the SubViewport renders the Sprite2D and TextureRect using Nearest, then the SubViewportContainer displays that output texture using its own filter. In this setup, the container inherits Linear, which could explain the blur when magnified.\r\n\r\nIf that’s the case, this might be expected behavior rather than an inheritance issue.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5807296808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5810860192","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746#issuecomment-5810860192","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746","id":5810860192,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWlqwoA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T08:45:22Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T08:45:22Z","body":"See also:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118424","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5810860192/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5811422975","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746#issuecomment-5811422975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123746","id":5811422975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWmNG_w","user":{"login":"fsfgrafb","id":86371613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzcxNjEz","avata